  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sixth Global Conference on Strengthening Synergies between Paris Agreement and the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The&#xa0;overall purpose conference is to strengthen and accelerate integrated action on climate change and the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) to enhance co-benefits. It seeks to leverage synergies between the two frameworks to promote equitable, climate-resilient, and sustainable development in developing countries while addressing critical global challenges and bridging gaps in policy, financing, and implementation.&#xa0;Further,&#xa0;the conference will enhance the bridging between the SDG&apos;s and climate actions at both political and practical levels. It will showcase thought leadership and empirical evidence on co-benefits of integrating the two agendas.</narrative>
  </description>
